        "original_id": "e687512e-0cd0-56b8-b56e-78dafc445fc7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cartoon Network Too, Nick Jr. Too, Teletoon\n- Products: Skatoony\n- Topics: channel launches, overnight reruns\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Jr. Too launched on 24 April 2006, the same day as rival channel Cartoon Network Too.\n- Cartoon Network Too aired some older shows during overnight hours, usually between midnight and 06:00, including Skatoony.\n- Cartoon Network Too used its overnight schedule for shows that were no longer being produced and were no longer in high demand.\n- Skatoony reruns are still occasionally shown on Teletoon in Canada.",
